  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 46 (Friday, March 10, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. CARTWRIGHT:\nH.R. 1540.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8, Clause 3 (relating to the power of\nCongress to regulate Commerce with foreign Nations, and among\nthe several States, and with Indian Tribes.)\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo create an NFIP affordability program.\n[Page H1280]\n</pre>",
